{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness8Be","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness8Be","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.color_8be","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.color_8be","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/Witness8Be.lean#L24-L28","doc":"Color content: Σ_{ℓ≥2} net(ℓ) — the degree ≥ 1 interaction content.\nThis is the \"M\" in the CMB analogy — the multi-body correlations\nthat the transfer matrix cannot capture per-generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.observable_8be","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.observable_8be","kind":"def","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/Witness8Be.lean#L19-L22","doc":"Observable amplitude: net(0) + net(1) — the optimal basis.\nDegree 0 + 1 content of the Gröbner NF. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.F_Pauli_8be_denom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.F_Pauli_8be_denom","kind":"def","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/Witness8Be.lean#L17-L17","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.net_8be","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.net_8be","kind":"def","line":14,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Arch